        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Chris Pine, Lindsay Lohan\n- Films: Just My Luck, Star Trek reboot film series, Unstoppable, Into the Woods, Hell or High Water, Wonder Woman\n- Roles: James T. Kirk, Will Colson, Cinderella's Prince, Toby Howard, Steve Trevor\n\nFacts:\n- Chris Pine was born on August 26, 1980, and he is an American actor.\n- Chris Pine played James T. Kirk in the Star Trek reboot film series from 2009 to 2016.\n- Chris Pine played Will Colson in Unstoppable in 2010.\n- Chris Pine played Cinderella's Prince in Into the Woods in 2014.\n- Chris Pine played Toby Howard in Hell or High Water in 2016.\n- Chris Pine played Steve Trevor in Wonder Woman in 2017.\n- Just My Luck is a 2006 film that stars Lindsay Lohan and Chris Pine as the main characters.",
